{
  "info": {
    "name": "Trazo · API JWT · Incremento 04",
    "description": "Ejecutar completa con Collection Runner y datos demo locales. Crea y elimina UNA publicación temporal de Ana; al finalizar revoca TODAS las sesiones de Ana (cookies y JWT). Los tokens se guardan solo en variables temporales de la ejecución; no exportar resultados con cuerpos o credenciales. Requiere MySQL, semilla original (12 publicaciones de Ana), HTTPS local y Preparar-Api.ps1. API limitada a Development/Testing. Ver docs/api.md.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://localhost:7280",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "demoPassword",
      "value": "Trazo.Demo2026!",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 · Sin Bearer: acceso rechazado",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
              "pm.test('Desafío Bearer', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('WWW-Authenticate')).to.include('Bearer'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/publicaciones",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "02 · Contraseña incorrecta",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
